<title>CHINA: Trading in Tysan shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Tysan shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of foundation piling concern Tysan Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares ended HK$0.02 down at HK$1.90 on Thursday on volume of 4.12 million shares.</p>
<p>Last month, Tysan said it was considering a spinoff for its foundation piling and machinery hiring and trading business in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
